### collections_records-list

List a collection's rows.

Every row of one collection matching the given filters and order.

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "collection": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Id of the collection to list records from."
    },
    "filters": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Field values a record must match, by field name.",
      "additionalProperties": true
    },
    "orderBy": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Name of a declared field to order by. Empty orders by path, which is stable."
    },
    "desc": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "description": "Reverse the order."
    },
    "limit": {
      "type": "integer",
      "description": "Maximum number of records to return. 0 means no limit."
    },
    "offset": {
      "type": "integer",
      "description": "Number of matching records to skip, for pagination."
    },
    "_reasoning": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "MANDATORY. NEVER FORGET. Explain why this specific tool is being called now, what outcome you expect, and the immediate next step if that helps clarify the call. Do not leave this empty.",
      "minLength": 1
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "collection",
    "_reasoning"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

### collections_records-update

Revalidate and rewrite a row.

Replace a record's fields and revalidate them. A refusal leaves the
stored record untouched — nothing between reading it and validating the new
data can have written anything.

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "collection": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Id of the record's collection."
    },
    "id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Identifier of the record to rewrite."
    },
    "data": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "The record's new fields, replacing the old ones wholesale.",
      "additionalProperties": true
    },
    "_reasoning": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "MANDATORY. NEVER FORGET. Explain why this specific tool is being called now, what outcome you expect, and the immediate next step if that helps clarify the call. Do not leave this empty.",
      "minLength": 1
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "collection",
    "id",
    "data",
    "_reasoning"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

